  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white py-12\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-0\">Articles</h1><span class=\"text-neutral-400 block mt-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">Texts written by the Bidders Highway team.</span></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 mb-8\"><nav class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-8\"><a href=\"/en/posts\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-700 border-neutral-300 hover:bg-neutral-200\">All</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=collections\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-stone-100 text-stone-700 border-stone-300 hover:bg-stone-200\">Collections</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=event\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-100\">Event</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=jacobs_takes\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-sky-700 text-white border-sky-700\">Jacob's takes</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=guides\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-100\">Guides</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=our_cars\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-rose-50 text-rose-800 border-rose-300 hover:bg-rose-100\">Our cars</a><a href=\"/en/posts?tag=featured_cars\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors bg-violet-50 text-violet-800 border-violet-300 hover:bg-violet-100\">Featured cars</a></nav><ul class=\"md:grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 gap-y-8 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 mb-8 mt-8 xl:grid-cols-3!\"><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-ceo-has-the-floor---june-26\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/852761ea61a1a3b84d2e5b943165a9a1\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The CEO has the floor - June\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">14 Jul 13:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The CEO has the floor - June</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">June was a strong month for us—with high sales volumes across every category...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-ceo-has-the-floor---may\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/a04055ddf9145fa353fd7884e128a077\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The CEO has the floor - May\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">18 Jun 12:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The CEO has the floor - May</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">Last month I wrote that it is not the seller who sets the price, but the market...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-ceo-has-the-floor---january-2026\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/11dd94d875822b3d619419ba1538e3db\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The CEO has the floor - January\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">18 Feb 16:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The CEO has the floor - January</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">The year has had an unusually strong start...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-ceo-has-the-floor---november\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/16f6b3e32ed9f589c6acfe13d2d71e07\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The CEO has the floor - November\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">28 Nov 12:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The CEO has the floor - November</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">November is going down in history as our strongest month to date, with a sell-through rate that has sometimes reached 90%...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-ceo-has-the-floor---august\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/8136eee1d7d88e7c0ae02db6bb2936d3\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The CEO has the floor - August\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">15 Sep 16:00</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The CEO has the floor - August</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">August is often a slightly quieter month on the auction scene, and so it is this year...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-ceo-has-the-floor---june\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/43dbe4425522baaae8331ce2bec6a8cf\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The CEO has the floor - June\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">15 Jul 17:40</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The CEO has the floor - June</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">The month of June began with anticipation – not least because May, which started slowly, ended at record speed...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-ceo-has-the-floor---february\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/c5bc314effd85df79ade457921075394\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The CEO has the floor - February\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">12 Mar 10:35</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The CEO has the floor - February</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">A prize-winning 1938 Dodge and a 1956 Corvette were some of the highlights from February's auctions...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-ceo-has-the-floor---january\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/46989ff125ad158d22f64f7e95f8f37d\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The CEO has the floor - January\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">11 Feb 10:35</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The CEO has the floor - January</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">January is always a bit of a strange month from a sales perspective. It is fickle and polarizing...</p></a></li><li class=\"post\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-ceo-has-the-floor---december%2Fjanuary\" class=\"transition-colors hover:text-jaffa\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/0aa5cbf914fa6871adf6652ba2fac7dc\" class=\"w-full rounded-sm object-cover hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"The CEO has the floor - December/January\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"490\" height=\"300\"><span class=\"block text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2\">21 Jan 10:35</span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-medium md:text-xl mb-1 mt-1\">The CEO has the floor - December/January</h2><p class=\"text-neutral-700\">Dear enthusiasts,\nit's time for us to make a New Year's resolution...</p></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"mb-8\"></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 lg:grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 py-12\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif uppercase text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-racing-700 flex gap-2 items-center mb-6\"><span class=\"icon text-3xl\">podcasts</span><span>Latest podcasts</span></h2><ul class=\"rounded-sm bg-off-white mb-6 lg:mb-0\"><li><a href=\"https://pod.space/dealenmedbilen/375-den-optimala-80-tals-vagnparken-bonusavsnitt\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-4 py-2 xl:py-4 w-full flex gap-4 justify-between items-center hover:opacity-80 hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 items-center\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/0001ae0f48763ce898eda727454cb558\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"375. Den optimala 80-talsvagnparken!\" class=\"max-h-[60px] xl:max-h-[80px]\"><span class=\"font-medium text-lg xl:text-xl max-w-xs\">375. Den optimala 80-talsvagnparken!</span></div><span class=\"text-right\">30 May 12:00</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://pod.space/dealenmedbilen/377-cirkusmusik-skit-suburban-och-en-porsches-existensberattigande\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-4 py-2 xl:py-4 w-full flex gap-4 justify-between items-center hover:opacity-80 hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 items-center\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/dad6e0e26fb4e013db43f6e72faf6d81\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"377. Cirkusmusik, skit-Suburban och en Porsches existensberättigande\" class=\"max-h-[60px] xl:max-h-[80px]\"><span class=\"font-medium text-lg xl:text-xl max-w-xs\">377. Cirkusmusik, skit-Suburban och en Porsches existensberättigande</span></div><span class=\"text-right\">08 Sep 12:00</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://pod.space/dealenmedbilen/378-kalles-nya-bil-och-en-cutlass-agares-ekonomiska-logik\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-4 py-2 xl:py-4 w-full flex gap-4 justify-between items-center hover:opacity-80 hover:bg-neutral-200 transiti